## DPoP

Google's current web-server OAuth guidance supports and recommends DPoP as optional additional token hardening. This PR does **not** bolt DPoP onto an unproven secret backend because doing it correctly requires a durable P-256 private-key + nonce lifecycle. Evaluate DPoP together with the Vault adapter after the credential-isolation path is replay-tested.

