## Failure behavior

- durable enqueue unavailable -> visible row falls back to `manual_required`;
- temporary internal read failure -> bounded retry;
- final attempt failure -> dead-letter;
- stale processing lease -> recover if attempts remain, otherwise dead-letter;
- stale worker after recovery -> conditional settlement returns `claim_lost`;
- cross-tenant durable job -> not selected because claim job type is organization-scoped.

